### Media library

### Folders (defaults created on first read)
GET {{SELLER_UI_URL}}/spg/content/api/v1/private/content/media/folders?store={{STORE_ID}}&pod={{POD_ID}}&lang={{LANG}}
Cookie: SESSION={{SESSION_ID}}

### Upload (multipart; repeat "files"; optional folderId)
POST {{SELLER_UI_URL}}/spg/content/api/v1/private/content/media?store={{STORE_ID}}&pod={{POD_ID}}&lang={{LANG}}&folderId=1
Content-Type: multipart/form-data; boundary=WebAppBoundary
Cookie: SESSION={{SESSION_ID}}

--WebAppBoundary
Content-Disposition: form-data; name="files"; filename="hero.jpg"
Content-Type: image/jpeg

< ./hero.jpg
--WebAppBoundary--

### List (folder, kind, q, used filters; count = page size)
GET {{SELLER_UI_URL}}/spg/content/api/v1/private/content/media?store={{STORE_ID}}&pod={{POD_ID}}&lang={{LANG}}&kind=IMAGE&used=false&page=0&count=24
Cookie: SESSION={{SESSION_ID}}

### One asset with its usage
GET {{SELLER_UI_URL}}/spg/content/api/v1/private/content/media/1?store={{STORE_ID}}&pod={{POD_ID}}&lang={{LANG}}
Cookie: SESSION={{SESSION_ID}}

### Edit metadata
PATCH {{SELLER_UI_URL}}/spg/content/api/v1/private/content/media/1?store={{STORE_ID}}&pod={{POD_ID}}&lang={{LANG}}
Content-Type: application/json
Cookie: SESSION={{SESSION_ID}}

{"folderId": 2, "altTexts": {"en": "Office desk"}, "title": "Hero", "tags": ["hero", "sale"]}

### Delete (409 MEDIA.REFERENCED unless force=true)
DELETE {{SELLER_UI_URL}}/spg/content/api/v1/private/content/media/1?store={{STORE_ID}}&pod={{POD_ID}}&lang={{LANG}}&force=false
Cookie: SESSION={{SESSION_ID}}

### Folders: create / rename / delete (moveTo required when not empty)
POST {{SELLER_UI_URL}}/spg/content/api/v1/private/content/media/folders?store={{STORE_ID}}&pod={{POD_ID}}&lang={{LANG}}
Content-Type: application/json
Cookie: SESSION={{SESSION_ID}}

{"name": "Campaigns"}

###
DELETE {{SELLER_UI_URL}}/spg/content/api/v1/private/content/media/folders/6?store={{STORE_ID}}&pod={{POD_ID}}&lang={{LANG}}&moveTo=1
Cookie: SESSION={{SESSION_ID}}
